This varargs <code>format()</code> variant may be costly. You should therefore
use the individual argument variants whenever possible;
<a href="#format(java.lang.String,java.lang.Object)"><code>format(String, Object)</code></a>, <a href="#format(java.lang.String,java.lang.Object,java.lang.Object)"><code>format(String, Object, Object)</code></a>, etc.
